1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
beautiful planet, a planet that we all share,

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:05,880
a planet of peace and a world that is richer, better,

3
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,500
and more beautiful than ever before.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,940
That can happen. It will happen.

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:12,380
It will happen, and I hope it can happen

6
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:15,220
